{"4450570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "This Is Golf", "steam_appid": 4450570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Is Golf</strong> is is first-person golf game where you use the mouse to shape the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the terrain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the shot happens in first person, you can walk around in third person to see what the hole looks like or to spectate your friend's &quot;crazy new stinger&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick from a wide variety of clubs, from the 5 iron to the 9 iron, pitching wedge, driver or putter, and they all have the own purpose. You will learn to choose right the more you hit with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural holes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hole is procedurally generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in lobbies of up to 8 players.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Is Golf</strong> is is first-person golf game where you use the mouse to shape the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the terrain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the shot happens in first person, you can walk around in third person to see what the hole looks like or to spectate your friend's &quot;crazy new stinger&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick from a wide variety of clubs, from the 5 iron to the 9 iron, pitching wedge, driver or putter, and they all have the own purpose. You will learn to choose right the more you hit with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural holes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hole is procedurally generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in lobbies of up to 8 players.</p>", "short_description": "This Is Golf is a casual but challenging first-person golf game with randomly generated holes. Shot shaping and distance are based entirely on mouse motion. Play solo or in lobbies of up to 8 players, and enjoy a fun, competitive, and slightly goofy golfing experience.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450570/f887504afc86f20647fc5c70e80d8ce956046150/header.jpg?t=1787962544", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450570/97c7c5c6f569c3cdfd55284df03ba6b473154465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787962544", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450570/97c7c5c6f569c3cdfd55284df03ba6b473154465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787962544", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 8565U (old laptop cpu)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeFo